{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.ex-p011","chapter":2,"chapterTitle":"বীজগাণিতিক রাশি","topic":"2.ex","topicTitle":"অনুশীলনী ২","section":null,"kind":"exercise","page":61,"text":"৪. যদি $x = b + c - a$, $y = c + a - b$, এবং $z = a + b - c$ হয়, তবে দেখাও যে,\n$$x^3 + y^3 + z^3 - 3xyz = 4(a^3 + b^3 + c^3 - 3abc)$$।","image":null,"verified":false,"reviewReasons":["verify-formula"]}
